\section{Barnes--Hut Tree Complexity}

\subsection{Definition}
The Barnes--Hut algorithm partitions space into an octree $\mathcal{T}$.
Force evaluation complexity:
\[
\mathcal{O}(N \log N).
\]

\subsection{Lemma}
For $N = 5 \times 10^8$ bodies:
\[
\log_2 N \approx 29.
\]

\subsection{Result}
\[
N \log N \approx 1.45 \times 10^{10}.
\]

